{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1000_p", "source_sha256": "94f01b8d600f1e55164e84c7b07d7bd23b64b0b22612cf293c013440ce811db2", "ja": "（もうすぐ期間限定の『ミリオンカフェ』がオープン！\nバリスタ担当の海美は、ラテアートを練習中だが……）", "zh": "（期间限定的『百万咖啡厅』马上就要开张了！负责咖啡师工作的海美正在练习拉花，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "81105a950e21d58ebc6f23d691b6937af61293208e265b8f906d65339434cb46", "ja": "えっと、まずはドリップコーヒーを淹れて、\nミルクをスチームして……あれっ、なんか違うかも？", "zh": "那个，先冲一杯滴滤咖啡，再把牛奶打成蒸汽奶泡……咦，好像哪里不太对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "1b6da0ef3fad8dc291c92ea2f58cd8aab4e9e69d814e5be98586c112f4f4089a", "ja": "あっ、ミルクはスチームしないで、\nそのままコーヒーに加えればいいんだっけ？", "zh": "啊，牛奶不用打发，\n直接加进咖啡里就可以了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a0005b9f5a4f5b9d15514b1037d43129eb70dd96ddf67e660200d6564999c97a", "ja": "海美、お疲れ様。\nなんだか苦戦してるみたいだな。", "zh": "海美，辛苦了。好像遇到点困难啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "4c1e6deeec4e4aa9cc88791231fe32808de9a181bc8d53d59bfd16a0916cdd1d", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！　どうしよ～！\n全然覚えられないよ～っ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！怎么办呀～！\n完全记不住啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "0a7f73851ad2c60d4648b410391070de53420f77d988aad00e3a78011bfe49e3", "ja": "種類がいっぱいあって、\n作り方を覚えるのが大変で……うーっ。", "zh": "种类太多了，光是记住做法就很难……呜——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2b87462677243cea631df9f64dc8bf0306bcc82d284cb949921c3ea589d145a1", "ja": "確かに。メニューを覚えるだけでも大変そうだな。", "zh": "确实。光是记住菜单就已经很不容易了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "2cb7c28b4f8adb0323c0f62023324ff2de4c364353ac30699c982a190bb9513c", "ja": "うん……でも、全部作れるようになりたいな。\n特にラテアートは、可愛くやりたいの！", "zh": "嗯……不过，我想要全部都学会做呢。\n特别是拉花，好想做得可爱一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "16be1adc7500ac9ee7ab2b4e9dd37b98a1d527ad021762544fd98bd8609b65ad", "ja": "綺麗に作れたら、女子力高そうだよね？\nでも、まずはメニューを覚えないと……。", "zh": "要是能做得漂亮，看起来女子力就会很高吧？不过，首先得把菜单背下来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9c0b175e32d898b348358922fca7bafae30c0529751f01b802f77e80d54d4c24", "ja": "そうだな……だったら、頭で覚えようとするんじゃ\nなくて、体で覚えてみたらどうだ？", "zh": "没错……既然这样，与其想着用脑子记住，不如试着用身体记住怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "626676fa7326477f361d4660f899e5f72211ac57ce4265b0cd5256aa1f3565ee", "ja": "体で、覚える……？\nそれって、どういうこと？", "zh": "用身体记住……？\n那是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1011_p", "source_sha256": "46b7dcb28885260044ba80bc385478e51ebfcb9d691aef47f9dad98a9e31bb20", "ja": "レシピじゃなくて、作る動きを覚えるんだ。\nダンスみたいに繰り返せば、覚えられるんじゃないか？", "zh": "不是去记菜谱，而是要记住制作的动作。\n像跳舞一样反复练习的话，应该就能记住了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "db8db3955a578deb24242a010b396690a193341c8ec783f8db8e84ebda6c2309", "ja": "なるほど……うん、それならできるかも！\nありがとう、{$P$}！", "zh": "原来如此……嗯，那样的话或许能做到！\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "c6272c216b9329302790040f3f7baf438fdd7ecb4e814fec0d7feb6f9866ad61", "ja": "私、やってみるね！\nうまくできたら、ラテアートも作ってみる！", "zh": "我来试试看！\n要是做好了，还要试着做拿铁拉花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cd0d81a560e37161d9362356a37e4a8d68b0b499015ac9463bf4ade292ba4705", "ja": "（海美がキッチンから戻ってきた。何も持って\nいないけど……上手くいかなかったのかな？）", "zh": "（海美从厨房回来了。虽然手里什么都没拿……难道没成功吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "e694f094a2231195ece71b47e6a2a9099ee8190e5e71c0e04fafe391dd028d19", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがと～！\nぜーんぶ覚えられたよ～！　やったねーっ☆", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你～！\n我已经全部记住啦～！太棒了～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2c878d192efe6fde0c5dad5c903e5af687b3aaa01729149f512a723780c608a8", "ja": "おっ、それはよかったな！\nけど、ラテアートはどうなったんだ？", "zh": "哦，那太好了！\n不过，拿铁拉花怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "30d34a25a8ccc45a898384b4ba25d773b93d72801b7ae3f089829da57c67bdf7", "ja": "あ、えへへ……そっちはまだヘタだったから。\n恥ずかしくなって、自分で飲んじゃった！", "zh": "啊，嘿嘿……因为那杯的拉花还画得不好嘛。\n觉得不好意思，就自己喝掉了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0283_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "2b88e31a92811dad55eed5f409881d14658265ee81ed6ea90db4c8a1ddd8a7f7", "ja": "{$P$}、練習に付き合って！\nたくさん飲んでもらうから……ご注文をどうぞっ☆", "zh": "{$P$}，陪我练习吧！\n我会让你喝很多的……请点单吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
